{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066066/block/singleImage/3279910/df/01M8DG00MQJJG6GR00H5Y4WFDP.png?updatedAt=1795751839\"/><figcaption>上環往蛇口客輪「新迅隆貳號」撞到青衣路友聯船廠對開船塢，多人受傷(無線新聞畫面)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（27日）早上9時25分，警方接報，青衣路對開海域有船隻意外。據報，一艘上環往蛇口客輪「新迅隆貳號」撞到青衣路友聯船廠對開船塢，至少25人受傷，其中5人嚴重，全部清醒，分別送往瑪嘉烈醫院及仁濟醫院治理， 有傷者要用頸箍協助 。消防出動消防船及流動傷者治療車，大批救護車在場戒備， 涉事客輪被拖到友聯船廠 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:50.045815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:28:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.409016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:15.063567+00:00","content_hash":"4e93f7216173f7c2d8257190540ce4d785d4006a70e7f7c3b0a3db26eb9b5251","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:50.045815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}